    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Now with Online Multiplayer!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recently released into public beta, you can now race <strong>online with your friends, or other players from around the world</strong>. Enjoy racing with our full fleet of cars and over 700 community-made tracks!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GeneRally 2 is a friendly top-down arcade racing game - with an easy-to-use, built-in track editor.</strong> GeneRally 2 is the sequel to the 2002 classic, GeneRally - one of the most played arcade racing games of all time! Have fun racing alone against the AI; with your friends in &quot;no split-screen necessary&quot; couch PvP; online with players from around the world; or try your hand at creating tracks and sharing them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GeneRally 2 is on the home stretch of Early Access - and will soon be reaching v1.0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.poster.avif?t=1749403174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.webm?t=1749403174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.mp4?t=1749403174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Top-down arcade racing game fun!</strong> The gameplay is easy to pick up, but with plenty of room for mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race online or offline - with friends, or against the AI!</strong> With online multiplayer, you can race with GeneRally 2 players from all over the world - but you can also gather up to 7 friends and play in no-splitscreen-necessary couch co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 unique cars.</strong> Rally, Single-Seater, Monster Truck, GT - you name it! Each car has its own performance characteristics and unique handling model. And more cars are being added on a regular basis!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 800 tracks (and counting)...</strong> Our community has produced over 800 tracks to date, and more are being created every day and uploaded to Steam Workshop. If that's not enough, create your own tracks, or import and race any of the tens of thousands that were created for GeneRally 1!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your own tracks.</strong> Using our built-in track editor, making the racing circuits of your dreams couldn't be easier! No special knowledge required. Join our track-making community and share your creations with the world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GeneRally 2 is a friendly top-down arcade racing game - with an easy-to-use, built-in track editor.</strong> GeneRally 2 is the sequel to the 2002 classic, GeneRally - one of the most played arcade racing games of all time! Have fun racing alone against the AI; with your friends in &quot;no split-screen necessary&quot; couch PvP; online with players from around the world; or try your hand at creating tracks and sharing them with the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GeneRally 2 is on the home stretch of Early Access - and will soon be reaching v1.0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.poster.avif?t=1749403174\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.webm?t=1749403174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104920/extras/e4f2aaab4ee45bc32fa95c9f1f07198c.mp4?t=1749403174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Top-down arcade racing game fun!</strong> The gameplay is easy to pick up, but with plenty of room for mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race online or offline - with friends, or against the AI!</strong> With online multiplayer, you can race with GeneRally 2 players from all over the world - but you can also gather up to 7 friends and play in no-splitscreen-necessary couch co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 unique cars.</strong> Rally, Single-Seater, Monster Truck, GT - you name it! Each car has its own performance characteristics and unique handling model. And more cars are being added on a regular basis!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 800 tracks (and counting)...</strong> Our community has produced over 800 tracks to date, and more are being created every day and uploaded to Steam Workshop. If that's not enough, create your own tracks, or import and race any of the tens of thousands that were created for GeneRally 1!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your own tracks.</strong> Using our built-in track editor, making the racing circuits of your dreams couldn't be easier! No special knowledge required. Join our track-making community and share your creations with the world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "GeneRally 2 is a top-down arcade racing game with a built-in track editor. Challenge the track records in time-trial; compete on the sofa with friends; or race online against people from around the world!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cThose who enjoyed the first game will be especially happy to know that [it's] back and better than ever!\u201d<br>RaceDepartment<br><br>\u201cWhat we\u2019ve got here is a challenging, entertaining and simple racing game with a few neat features. Cars are rewarding to drive and the user interface is clear and concise. Everything just works.\u201d<br>Traxion<br><br>\u201cGeneRally 2 is a fun amalgamation of Super Off Road, Micro Machines and Super Sprint. We loved it.\u201d<br>Comesp<br>",
